WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.481
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.481 --> 00:00:06.020
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.520
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:09.852
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.852 --> 00:00:13.694
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:13.694 --> 00:00:17.196
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:17.319 --> 00:00:22.264
Sort parameter updates into Training.

00:00:22.264 --> 00:00:27.261
Try Training for fixed-model calculations.

00:00:27.261 --> 00:00:32.239
Classify prompt context as Inference.

00:00:32.239 --> 00:00:34.993
Check the three classifications.

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:40.823
Show explanations for all categories.

00:00:40.823 --> 00:00:45.771
Correct fixed-model calculations to Inference.

00:00:45.771 --> 00:00:49.353
Check the corrected classification.

00:00:49.353 --> 00:00:52.092
Reveal the explanations after achieving 3/3.

00:00:52.092 --> 00:00:59.837
Review the first classification with its explanation.
